Z||000000||fieroburton||07-12-2001||01:58 AM||||I just got back from seeing fast and the furious and now im really car crazed! more than usual !  so I thot I should take haze's suggestion and dye my tan and dark tan 84 SE interior black and red ! then i'l get black and red seats from mr.mike. so I went to pep-boys and got attitude ! so I gave them the finger and went to wall-mart and they had the same stuff real cheap so I got it and went home . so im sitting hear and thinking I should ask all of you for some tips before I start ! im using plasti-kote ultra vinyl color , black and red . what should I do to prep the vinyl? and do any of you have any cool dyed fiero interior pictures ?<P>    really appreciate it  <BR>                  Fiero Burton||||reg||5
Z||000001||The Fieromaster||07-12-2001||02:09 AM||||Get all the goddamn armorall off.. god that stuff is a pain int the A$$!!  You gotta remove ANY and ALL protectants that are on there or it wont stick for $hit!  Use whatever you can to get it off but afterwords soap and water it to get the cleaner off then let it dry real good!<P>Thats how i did my dash, dors, and handles in black!<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That, Wrecked Better"<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">      <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
