Z||000003||Monkeyman||07-12-2001||06:11 PM||||A solution of Dawn dish soap and water should take off all of the friggin' Armorall.  Personally, I would ditch the PlastiCote and buy a few cans of SEM paint.  It's meant for flexible surfaces.  I bought mine at the local CarQuest for around $6/can.  I'll be painting mine as soon as I get my new carpet (I don't want to have to dismantle the interior any more than necessary).<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
